所以我只能坐在那里，看着那些混蛋欺负我哥哥？

643
00:35:22.080 --> 00:35:26.240
Somehow I'd been swearing like a sailor and getting away with it since age five.
不知怎么的，我从五岁起就开始满嘴脏话却安然无恙。

644
00:35:27.200 --> 00:35:31.840
Emmett smiled at me, gently, like he understood something I didn't.
埃梅特温柔地对我笑，就像他懂一些我不懂的事。

645
00:35:32.960 --> 00:35:38.160
Yes, I didn't want to cry, but I started imagining it,
是的，我不想哭，但我开始想象那个画面，

646
00:35:38.800 --> 00:35:43.856
watching on and doing nothing as Emmett got bullied, and my eyes welled up.
眼睁睁看着埃梅特被欺负却什么都不做，我的眼泪涌了上来。

647
00:35:43.856 --> 00:35:44.800
I turned away.
我转过头去。

648
00:35:46.000 --> 00:35:48.575
Fine, I said, get beat up.
好吧，我说，挨打去吧。

649
00:35:48.575 --> 00:35:50.061
What do I care?
关我屁事？

650
00:35:50.061 --> 00:35:54.320
Darcy, get out Emmett, just leave me alone.
达西，出去 埃梅特，别理我。

651
00:35:54.320 --> 00:35:58.320
Emmett nodded and climbed down from the treehouse.
埃mett点点头，从树屋上爬了下来。

652
00:35:58.320 --> 00:36:00.480
He never yelled back at me,
他从来没有对我大吼大叫过，

653
00:36:01.040 --> 00:36:03.599
not once, our entire childhood.
一次也没有，在我们整个童年里。

654
00:36:03.599 --> 00:36:05.746
Things changed after that.
那之后事情就变了。

655
00:36:05.746 --> 00:36:08.800
I'd gone from being jealous of Emmett
我对埃mett的情感，从嫉妒

656
00:36:08.800 --> 00:36:12.378
to being his protector to being, I didn't know what.
变成保护他，再到后来，我也不知道算什么。

657
00:36:12.378 --> 00:36:15.200
The next day, when Devano Shields started
第二天，当德瓦诺·希尔兹开始

658
00:36:15.200 --> 00:36:20.644
picking on Emmett, I kept chatting with my friends, pretending I didn't notice.
找埃mett麻烦时，我一直在和朋友聊天，假装没看见。

659
00:36:20.644 --> 00:36:22.160
Emmett just sat there,
埃mett就坐在那里，

660
00:36:22.720 --> 00:36:27.071
looking out the window, peacefully ignoring it.
看着窗外，平静地无视这一切。

661
00:36:27.071 --> 00:36:30.034
Civil disobedience, like Gandhi.
像甘地一样的公民不服从。

662
00:36:30.034 --> 00:36:30.960
Admarable,
令人钦佩，

663
00:36:30.960 --> 00:36:32.305
but not my style.
但不是我的风格。

664
00:36:32.305 --> 00:36:38.000
That day at lunch, I walked by Devon's seat and hocked a big, juicy luge
那天吃午饭时，我路过德文的座位，吐了一大口浓痰

665
00:36:38.000 --> 00:36:41.076
into his Hawaiian punch when he wasn't looking.
趁他不注意吐进了他的夏威夷果汁里。

666
00:36:41.076 --> 00:36:43.760
Then I watched from across the cafeteria,
然后我坐在餐厅的另一头看着，

667
00:36:43.760 --> 00:36:46.120
as Devon drank every last drop.
看着德文把最后的一滴都喝了下去。

668
00:36:46.120 --> 00:36:50.080
I never told anyone, and I didn't feel bad about it.
我从来没告诉过任何人，也一点没觉得内疚。

669
00:36:50.640 --> 00:36:54.080
My luge was the most natural ingredient in that Hawaiian punch.
我的口水可以说是那杯夏威夷果汁里最天然的成分了。

670
00:36:55.440 --> 00:37:00.316
It can be weird, having a big brother whose path is so different from yours.
有一个人生轨迹和你完全不同的大哥哥，感觉会很怪。

671
00:37:00.316 --> 00:37:01.920
As the neuro-typical kid,
作为神经典型的小孩，

672
00:37:01.920 --> 00:37:05.696
