老师们都很喜欢你。

685
00:37:38.877 --> 00:37:41.600
You do your homework by yourself.
你独自完成家庭作业。

686
00:37:41.600 --> 00:37:45.370
You don't need speech therapy or open-heart surgery.
你不需要言语治疗或心脏直视手术。

687
00:37:45.370 --> 00:37:46.240
You're easy.
你让人省心。

688
00:37:47.600 --> 00:37:49.097
And there's the rub.
问题就在这里。

689
00:37:49.097 --> 00:37:54.036
You go from miracle child to latch-key kid in the blink of an eye.
你在眨眼之间从奇迹宝宝变成了钥匙儿童。

690
00:37:54.036 --> 00:37:54.560
My once
我曾经

691
00:37:54.560 --> 00:37:59.840
anti-establishment parents had settled down in a wealthy suburb full of cookie-cutter homes,
反传统的父母在一个富裕的郊区安顿下来，那里到处都是千篇一律的房子、

692
00:37:59.840 --> 00:38:02.568
cookie-cutter families, cookie-cutter kids.
千篇一律的家庭、千篇一律的孩子。

693
00:38:02.568 --> 00:38:05.360
They wanted a daughter who fit that picture.
他们想要一个符合那个画面的女儿。

694
00:38:06.320 --> 00:38:10.400
And then they wanted to put that picture up on the fridge and walk away.
然后他们想把那个画面贴在冰箱上，就再也不管了。

695
00:38:11.600 --> 00:38:16.400
All those things they were never going to take for granted if they had a non-disabled child,
所有那些如果他们拥有一个残障儿童就绝不会视为理所当然的事情，

696
00:38:17.200 --> 00:38:19.676
they totally took them for granted.
他们却完全视为理所当然了。

697
00:38:19.676 --> 00:38:23.920
But I still had to keep stacking those blocks long after the
但掌声停止后，

698
00:38:23.920 --> 00:38:25.195
applause stopped.
我还是得继续堆那些积木。

699
00:38:25.195 --> 00:38:25.495
Why?
为什么？

700
00:38:25.495 --> 00:38:31.120
Because for the first five years of Emmett's life, my parents feared they'd
因为在埃mett生命的头五年里，我的父母一直害怕他们会

701
00:38:31.200 --> 00:38:37.360
never have a kid who would go to college, get married, make them grandparents, become a successful
别生那种以后会上大学、结婚、让你当上祖父母、成为一个成功且

702
00:38:37.360 --> 00:38:42.917
independent grown-up, qualified to one day do the most important job of all.
独立的成年人、有资格在未来担当最重要职责的孩子。

703
00:38:42.917 --> 00:38:44.160
Watch over Emmett
照顾好埃mett

704
00:38:44.160 --> 00:38:45.336
once they were gone.
等他们离去之后。

705
00:38:45.336 --> 00:38:49.040
My parents always say they don't want me to feel that pressure,
我父母总是说他们不想让我感到这种压力，

706
00:38:49.840 --> 00:38:50.737
but it's a lie.
但那是假的。

707
00:38:50.737 --> 00:38:52.112
And it should be a lie.
而且这本来就该是假的。

708
00:38:52.112 --> 00:38:55.760
Of course they want me to help take care of Emmett after they
他们当然希望我能在他们

709
00:38:55.760 --> 00:38:56.204
die.
去世后帮忙照顾埃mett。

710
00:38:56.204 --> 00:38:59.425
And of course I should do it.
我当然也应该这么做。

711
00:38:59.425 --> 00:39:01.313
And I will do it.
而且我会这么做的。

712
00:39:01.313 --> 00:39:03.423
Because I love him.
因为我爱他。

713
00:39:03.423 --> 00:39:05.200
It's just a lot.
只是担子确实很重。

714
00:39:06.560 --> 00:39:10.480
